25,2,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
26,2,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
27,2,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
28,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
29,2,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
30,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"It seems we are billed by area, not headcount, and moving power is quite expensive per desk.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The noise is much louder by the door, and the physio says it takes days to get a chair right.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,May,,"Setting up every morning takes up to nine minutes, and past shuffles caused weeks of interruptions.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Daylight is a major complaint, and our arrival times vary wildly, which makes first-come-first-serve unfair.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Sitting together helped project communication and helped new joiners learn the unwritten rules.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, those interruptions sound costly. @Minato, the physical setup time is a concern if we move often.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Minato,,"Yes, I worry about the noise and the chairs.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, exactly. The time lost to setup and shuffling is a hidden tax on our productivity.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, your point about proximity is valid, but we can't ignore the daylight disparity.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree, but I think the social benefit of sitting together is very important.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"If we change the layout frequently, the power costs and the billing will be a burden.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Minato,,I think we need a place where we can stay settled for a while.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,May,,I agree with Minato. Constant movement sounds like a nightmare for my schedule.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If we have fixed seats, we just need to be honest about who gets the window.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, as long as we are grouped to help each other, I can handle the wall.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Victoria,,It seems we all value stability and functional proximity over flexibility.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Minato,,I just want a quiet spot that fits my back.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,May,,I'm definitely against anything that requires a daily setup routine.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,Then we are leaning toward a permanent arrangement.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree, as long as the grouping is intentional.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
