55,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option A provides the stability and cost-control I'm looking for.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Minato,,A seems best for my chair and the noise levels.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,May,,I vote for A. I can't deal with the morning setup of Option C.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,A allows us to settle the window issue once and for all.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"A is good, but B would let everyone have a turn at the window.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, B would mean paying for power re-runs and facing those interruptions May mentioned.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Minato,,And the physio said the chairs take days to adjust. B would be tiring.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,May,,Exactly. B is just a slower version of the chaos in C.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, the cost and time loss make B impractical.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I see. I didn't think about the power costs.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"So, are we in agreement on Option A?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Minato,,"Yes, I think so.","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,May,,Definitely A.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'm on board with A.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll go with A then.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
